      "title": {
        "en": "Supportive doctors and welcoming front desk"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners consistently commend the veterinary staff and technicians for their friendly demeanour, deep medical knowledge, and thorough approach. Reviewers frequently mention Dr. Lee and Dr. Shelson for taking ample time to answer all questions without pressure. Clients appreciate that the entire team creates a supportive atmosphere during well visits and routine exams."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 14,
      "title": {
        "en": "Proactive calming measures for nervous companions"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients frequently note the exceptional care and gentle handling shown toward anxious dogs and sensitive cats. Reviewers mention that the staff proactively offers calming techniques, such as prescribing anti-anxiety support before visits or using breed-specific muzzles when needed. Owners report feeling relieved that their pets were treated with patience and affection."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "communication",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 7,
      "title": {
        "en": "Clear medical explanations and post-vaccine calls"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers praise the clinic for clear, transparent communication and attentive post-visit follow-ups. Pet parents note that veterinarians explain vaccine schedules, dental care, and exam findings in plain language. Clients also appreciate receiving prompt follow-up calls after vaccinations to check on their pet's recovery, fostering trust between families and the veterinary team."
      }
    }
  ],
